date: TBD (not yet shipped as of 2026-04-12; expected around April 8 based on monthly cadence)\n\n**Root features.json (long-running features):**\n- \"Unsafe Evolution\" — `id: unsafe-evolution`, repos: roslyn + runtime, preview feature for .NET 11, stable in .NET 12, callout: \"This is a preview feature for .NET 11.\"\n\n**PR data extracted (used for changes.json + features.json):**\nAll data is in-memory from agent results. Key highlights by component:\n\n*Runtime (dotnet/runtime):*\n- **Enable runtime-async for shared framework net11.0+** — PR #126343 ⭐ HIGH VALUE (runtime-async default milestone)\n- **Add JsonNamingPolicy.PascalCase** — PR #124644 ⭐ HIGH VALUE (new System.Text.Json API)\n- **Add unsafe evolution attributes** — PR #125721 ⭐ HIGH VALUE (Unsafe Evolution feature)\n- **JIT: skip saving unmutated locals in reused continuations** — PR #125615 (runtime-async JIT opt)\n- **JIT: null out exceptions in reused continuations** — PR #125869 (runtime-async JIT opt)\n- **Relax RandomAccess type requirements** — PR #125512 (non-seekable file support)\n- **Allow null arguments in ProcessStartInfo** — PR #126076 (nullable improvement)\n- **Fix IndexOutOfRangeException in FrozenHashTable from huge collections** — PR #125555 (important bug fix)\n- **Improve HashSet<T> performance (JIT bounds check elimination)** — PR #125893\n- **TarWriter: use HardLink entries for hard-linked files** — PR #123874\n- **Synchronize PaxTarEntry ExtendedAttributes with property setters** — PR #123990\n- **Add VectorXx.Asin + vectorize TensorPrimitives.Asin** — PR #126052\n- **Fix SafeFileHandle.CanSeek performance regression** — PR #125807 (regression fix)\n- **Fix OOM in BinHexDecoder/Base64Decoder/XmlSchemaValidator** — PR #125930\n- **Improve runtime-async support on linux-riscv64** — PR #125446\n- **arm64: Fold negative variable eq/ne to 0** — PR #124332 (JIT opt)\n- **[SRM] Optimize MetadataBuilder.GetOrAddConstantBlob** — PR #121223 (perf)\n\n*EF Core (dotnet/efcore):*\n- **Cosm