with packages.config ignoring all suppressions after first** — PR #7234 (bug fix)\n- **Fix NU1107 message guidance for CPVM with transitive pinning** — PR #7235 (UX)\n- **AOT compatible: NuGet.Protocol** — PR #7193 (NativeAOT compatibility)\n- **NuGet.Packaging AOT compatible** — PR #7197 (NativeAOT compatibility)\n- **Reduce allocations in LicenseExpressionTokenizer** — PR #7237 (perf)\n\n*WinForms (dotnet/winforms):*\n- **Fix InvalidCastException in Control.OnHandleDestroyed** — PR #14295 (bug fix)\n- **Fix ComboBox.ObjectCollection.CopyTo copies Entry instead of item** — PR #14075 (bug fix)\n- **Multi-target System.Private.Windows.Core** — PR #14384 (internal refactor, skip)\n\n*WPF (dotnet/wpf):*\n- **Fix Sdk.props space to avoid MSB4281** — PR #11470 (minor fix)\n\n*Templating (dotnet/templating):*\n- **Make projects AOT compatible** — PR #10006 (NativeAOT)\n- **Fix duplicate key handling** — PR #10049 (bug fix)\n\n*Razor (dotnet/razor):* Mostly IDE/tooling changes — apply product-boundary rule. Notable:\n- Most are editor/LSP features → skip for ASP.NET Core product notes\n\n*FSharp (dotnet/fsharp):* Mostly agentic workflow infra changes in this snapshot — need targeted filtering\n\n*ASP.NET Core (dotnet/aspnetcore):* Agent completed but output was very large (stored in `/tmp/1776010395917-copilot-tool-output-mm1z12.txt`) — need to read key highlights\n\n**Directory structure for preview2 (template for preview3):**\n```\nrelease-notes/11.0/preview/preview2/\n  README.md, aspnetcore.md, containers.md, efcore.md, fsharp.md,\n  libraries.md, release.json, runtime.md, sdk.md, wpf.md,\n  api-diff/, dotnetmaui.md, 11.0.0-preview.2.md\n```\n\n**Preview1 had additional files:** csharp.md, msbuild.md, visualbasic.md, winforms.md, containers.md\n\n**Existing preview3 directory:** Does NOT exist yet\n\n**No existing release-notes PR branches** in the repo (git branch -r shows nothing matching \"release-notes\")\n</technical_details>\n\n<important_files>\n- `release-notes