```
## .NET 11 Preview 3 Release Notes

Initial draft of release notes for .NET 11 Preview 3.

**Milestone:** `11.0.0-preview.3.26170.106` (build on `release/11.0.1xx-preview3` branch — not yet officially released as of this run)

**Base ref:** `v11.0.0-preview.2.26159.112`
**Head ref:** `origin/release/11.0.1xx-preview3`

### Files added (17)

| File | Content |
|------|---------|
| `README.md` | Index with links to all component files |
| `runtime.md` | Runtime Async enabled for net11.0+, Unsafe Evolution attrs, JIT opts, bug fixes |
| `libraries.md` | JsonNamingPolicy.PascalCase, RandomAccess non-seekable, Tar improvements, Vector Asin |
| `aspnetcore.md` | Blazor Virtualize variable-height items, zstd Content-Encoding, HTTP/2+3 fixes |
| `efcore.md` | Cosmos DB session token tracking, tools platform-specific app warning |
| `msbuild.md` | CLI worker node fix, virtual project references, TaskEnvironment API, bug fixes |
| `nuget.md` | File-based app CLI support, --allow-untrusted-root signing, bug fixes |
| `sdk.md` | NETSDK1005 fix, templating AOT compatibility |
| `winforms.md` | Bug fixes |
| `wpf.md` | Minor infrastructure fix |
| `csharp.md` | Placeholder (C# 14 details TBD) |
| `fsharp.md` | Placeholder (F# details TBD) |
| `visualbasic.md` | No VB changes this preview |
| `dotnetmaui.md` | Link to dotnet/maui releases |
| `containers.md` | Link to dotnet-docker releases |
| `11.0.0-preview.3.md` | Binaries download stub |
| `release.json` | Release metadata |

### Highlights

- **Runtime Async milestone** — enabled by default for net11.0+ shared framework (dotnet/runtime#126343)
- **Unsafe Evolution** — preview attribute types added (dotnet/runtime#125721)
- **JIT async optimizations** — two continuation-reuse optimizations (dotnet/runtime#125615, #125869)
- **`JsonNamingPolicy.PascalCase`** — new System.Text.Json naming policy (dotnet/runtime#124644)
- **Blazor Virtualize variable-height items** — the `Virtualize` component now measures item height dynamically (dotnet/aspnetcore#64964)
- **zstd Content-Encoding** — Zstandard compression in ASP.NET Core (dotnet/aspnetcore#65479)
- **MSBuild CLI worker node fix** — worker nodes now use MSBuild from .NET CLI (dotnet/msbuild#13452)
- **NuGet file-based app CLI support** — `dotnet nuget` commands work with file-based `.cs` apps (nuget/nuget.client#7169)
- **EF Core Cosmos session token tracking** — improved reliability for failure recovery (dotnet/efcore#37941)

### Open questions / items needing human review

1. **C# 14 features** — Roslyn diff contains ~150 PRs. Human review needed to identify user-facing C# 14 language features shipping in Preview 3.
2. **F# features** — F# diff dominated by agentic workflow infrastructure changes. Human review needed.
3. **Release date** — Preview 3 has not shipped yet. `release.json` has empty `release-date`.
4. **Binary download links** — `11.0.0-preview.3.md` is a stub pending official release.
5. **Community contributors** — Section in `runtime.md` is incomplete; PR authors need cross-referencing.

### Note on tooling

The `release-notes-gen` tool was unavailable this run (no GitHub auth token). Changes were extracted via git log analysis. `changes.json` and `features.json` were not generated; a future run with auth should regenerate these.
```

